SendmailAnalyzer 10.0.16

Creator and maintainer of SendmailAnalyzer 10:
Nazcar <nazcar@almogavers.net>

SendmailAnalyzer 10 is a modernization and new implementation inspired by the
concepts, reports and historical behavior of the original SendmailAnalyzer by
Gilles Darold (copyright 2002-2020):
https://github.com/darold/sendmailanalyzer

SendmailAnalyzer 10 uses its own text-based project branding and does not ship
the historical Sendmail "Bat" logo.

